<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct wheat imports down 17.1 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct wheat imports down 17.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 6.85 million tonnes of wheat in the first 10 months of this year, down 17.1 percent from the same period in 1995, the Futures Herald newspaper quoted customs figures as saying on Monday.</p>
<p>China's wheat imports were 510,000 tonnes in October alone, the figures showed. No comparative figures were given for the month.</p>
</text>
